  // reused directly), failing closed to INDETERMINATE/PID_INDETERMINATE with
  // no livenessProbe at all. This test now supplies a REAL, independently-
  // verifiable livenessProbe legitimately crediting DEAD -- genuine authority
  // for the happy-path crash-recovery case, distinct from the Section D
  // attack test below (unchanged), which deliberately supplies NO
  // livenessProbe to keep proving the fail-closed PID_INDETERMINATE posture.
  // FOLLOW-UP dispatch (classifyAbandonedRootRecovery redesign): all 5 tests
  // in this describe block now go through the injected-once authority
  // factory uniformly -- createAbandonedRootRecoveryAuthority({livenessProbe})
  // returns a classify({repoId,instanceId}) function with no per-call
